@host = http://localhost:5234

### All upcoming classes
GET {{host}}/api/classes

### Filtered: yoga only, with open spots
GET {{host}}/api/classes?category=Yoga&onlyOpen=true

### One class
GET {{host}}/api/classes/1

### Class that doesn't exist (404)
GET {{host}}/api/classes/9999

### Book a class (201)
POST {{host}}/api/classes/1/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "memberName": "Api Tester",
  "memberEmail": "api@example.com"
}

### Book the same email again (409)
POST {{host}}/api/classes/1/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "memberName": "Api Tester",
  "memberEmail": "api@example.com"
}

### Invalid request (400)
POST {{host}}/api/classes/1/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "memberName": "",
  "memberEmail": "not-an-email"
}
